-- === ADD 4 (v13): Parry Boost — MIXED Bloodmoon + Invisible, single counter, no double-fire ===\
-- Mix strategy:\
--   - Bloodmoon's _PARRY_PATCH hook (modern, same as Invisible) handles the remote fire\
--   - Invisible's distance math: emergency distance + timing-based threshold\
--   - SINGLE global parry counter: once any parry fires, 0.4s hard lockout\
--     for BOTH this boost loop AND Bloodmoon's MainConnection loop.\
--   - Lag reduction: cache ping every 0.5s, throttle to every 2nd frame.\
