        -- double respawn replication). The stale handler then reset\
        -- state the newer handler had just rebuilt, ran updateOverhead\
        -- against the NEW character while holding the OLD one, and\
        -- watchCharacter() landed the ChildAdded watcher on a DEAD\
        -- character (the live one never got a watcher until the next\
        -- death). The newest invocation owns the respawn - older ones\
        -- just leave.\
        if player.Character ~= char then return end\
